    "description": "An interactive categorization tool for Grade 7 Science (NCERT Chapter 3). Seven category bins are displayed at the top, each with a distinct color: Cooking (red), Lighting (amber), Transportation (blue), Heating & Cooling (cyan), Entertainment (purple), Communication (green), Others (grey). Below, 14 shuffled appliance cards are displayed with Indian appliance names. Students drag each card into the correct category bin. Instant green checkmark for correct placement, red shake for incorrect. Progress bar shows how many items sorted. Final score displayed. Indian educational context with warm amber theme. Clean drag-and-drop interface optimized for touch screens.",
    "topic": "Uses of Electricity in Daily Life",
